// # Satellite Communications, DVB-S2X & GNSS Positioning Facade
//
// Logline: Standard library facade re-exporting all 49 DVB-S2X, CPM, Satellite Link Budget, ISL Laser, and GNSS modules.
//
// Setup: Pure standard library facade module importing all satellite_dvb domain companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import all 49 modular satellite physical layer, DVB-S2X/RCS2, ISL laser, and GNSS submodules.
//   2. Define top-level unified satellite transceiver, GNSS multi-constellation, and ISL configurations.
//   3. Provide factory constructors and API shims for seamless openOODA satellite system integration.

